              "cardId": "lower-limb-model-ns10-423",
              "sourceLine": 423
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "curated-ddbfd44ac0",
          "answer": "Passes through the proximal interosseous membrane into the anterior leg, descends with the deep fibular nerve and continues as dorsalis pedis at the ankle.",
